# Backend Python

- Python 3.12+, async everywhere (SQLAlchemy async, FastAPI async handlers).
- `from __future__ import annotations` in all Python files.
- Ruff: line-length 88, double quotes, select E/F/I.
- Use existing patterns in `app/api/`, `app/models/`, `app/schemas/` for new endpoints.
- Engine changes: read `runner.py`, `orchestrator.py`, `tools.py` before editing agent lifecycle or tool access.
